{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38343","headline":"岐下闻杜鹃 · 吴融","name":"岐下闻杜鹃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"化去蛮乡北，飞来渭水西。\n爲多亡国恨，不忍故山啼。\n怨已惊秦凤，灵应识汉鸡。\n数声烟漠漠，余思草萋萋。\n楼迥波无际，林昏日又低。\n如何不肠断，家近五云溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}